# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Local session state and site configuration. The site registry lives outside
# the repo by design (see docs/site-config.md) -- if one ever appears in here,
# it is a mistake, and a mistake that may carry a token.
/.reaper-state/
*.local
*.local.*
reaper.toml
token
token.*

# Results, on their way back from a session. reaper is a tenant of itself, so
# this directory is real here rather than hypothetical: it is where a run's
# traces and artifacts land, and none of it is source.
/out/

# Editor and OS droppings
*~
.#*
\#*#
.DS_Store

# A CARGO_HOME that ci/build-target.sh puts inside the workspace, because the
# workspace was the only thing the Bitbucket pipeline that dispatched it could
# key a cache on and reach. Never present on a workstation.
/.cargo_cache/

# Release binaries on their way to Bitbucket Downloads, assembled by
# ci/build-target.sh. Built, named after a target triple, uploaded, discarded.
/dist/
